{
  "uid": "ce-metrics-main",
  "title": "Engineering Flow Metrics",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "5m",
  "version": 4,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Flow KPIs",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Flow Velocity",
      "description": "Average PRs merged per week (rolling 4 weeks)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ce-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "flow_velocity_prs_per_week{project=\"Sovren\"}",
          "legendFormat": "PRs/week",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 10 }
            ]
          },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Flow Time (Median)",
      "description": "Median hours from PR creation to merge",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ce-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "flow_time_median_hours{project=\"Sovren\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Median",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "h",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 8 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 24 }
            ]
          },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Flow Load (WIP)",
      "description": "Number of open PRs right now",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ce-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "flow_load{project=\"Sovren\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Open PRs",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 3 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Flow Efficiency",
      "description": "Ratio of active work to total activity",
      "type": "gauge",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ce-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "flow_efficiency_ratio{project=\"Sovren\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Efficiency",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.15 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.3 }
            ]
          },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      }
    },

    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 2,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Flow Velocity — Value Delivered",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "title": "PRs Merged per Week",
      "description": "Weekly throughput of merged pull requests",
      "type": "barchart",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ce-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "flow_velocity_weekly{project=\"Sovren\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{week}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "axisLabel": "PRs merged"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "xTickLabelRotation": 0,
        "showValue": "always",
        "stacking": "none",
        "groupWidth": 0.7,
        "barWidth": 0.8,
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "title": "PRs Merged (Last 4 Weeks Total)",
      "description": "Total PRs merged in rolling 4-week window",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ce-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "flow_velocity_total_4w{project=\"Sovren\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Total",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }]
          },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "title": "Lines Changed per PR",
      "description": "Additions and deletions per merged PR",
      "type": "barchart",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ce-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "flow_lines_added{project=\"Sovren\"}",
          "legendFormat": "+{{slug}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "expr": "flow_lines_deleted{project=\"Sovren\"}",
          "legendFormat": "-{{slug}}",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "axisLabel": "Lines"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "^\\+" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "^-" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showValue": "auto",
        "stacking": "none",
        "groupWidth": 0.7,
        "barWidth": 0.8,
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "hidden" }
      }
    },

    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "id": 3,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Flow Time — Speed of Delivery",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "title": "Flow Time per PR",
      "description": "Hours from PR creation to merge (lower is better)",
      "type": "barchart",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ce-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "flow_time_hours{project=\"Sovren\"} > 0",
          "legendFormat": "PR #{{pr}} {{slug}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "h",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": { "mode": "continuous-GrYlRd" },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "gradientMode": "scheme",
            "axisLabel": "Hours to merge"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showValue": "always",
        "stacking": "none",
        "groupWidth": 0.7,
        "barWidth": 0.8,
        "xTickLabelRotation": 0,
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "hidden" }
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {},
            "sort": [{ "field": "Value", "desc": true }]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "title": "Flow Time Distribution",
      "description": "Median, average, and P90 flow times",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ce-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "flow_time_median_hours{project=\"Sovren\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Median",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "flow_time_avg_hours{project=\"Sovren\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Average",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "flow_time_p90_hours{project=\"Sovren\"}",
          "legendFormat": "P90",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "h",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 8 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 24 }
            ]
          },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "vertical"
      }
    },

    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "id": 4,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Flow Efficiency — Active Work Ratio",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "title": "Phase Distribution",
      "description": "How time is spent across CE workflow phases",
      "type": "piechart",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ce-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "flow_phase_events{project=\"Sovren\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{phase}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "work" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "plan" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "blue", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "review" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "adhoc" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "dark-gray", "mode": "fixed" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "right" },
        "pieType": "donut",
        "displayLabels": ["percent"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "title": "Flow Efficiency Note",
      "description": "Flow Efficiency measures active work vs wait time",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 16, "x": 8, "y": 24 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## How Flow Efficiency Works\n\n**Flow Efficiency** = Active Work Time / Total Time\n\nIn the CE workflow:\n- **Active work** = `work` phase (writing code)\n- **Wait/overhead** = `plan`, `review`, `compound`, `adhoc`\n\nThe CE workflow intentionally invests ~80% in planning and review, so a ~20% efficiency ratio is **by design** — it means quality gates are working.\n\n### Interpreting the gauge:\n- **< 15%** = Too much overhead — simplify process\n- **15-30%** = Healthy CE workflow balance\n- **> 30%** = May be skipping quality steps\n\n### Data collection\nPhase tracking starts when you run `/workflows:plan`, `/workflows:work`, etc. Historical sessions show as `adhoc` until the phase detection hooks have been running.\n\n*Data will populate as more sessions use the workflow commands.*"
      }
    },

    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
      "id": 5,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Flow Load — Work in Progress",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "title": "Current Open PRs",
      "description": "Active work in progress — lower is better (limit WIP)",
      "type": "gauge",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ce-prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "flow_load{project=\"Sovren\"}",
          "legendFormat": "WIP",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 10,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 3 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "showThresholdLabels": true,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "title": "WIP Guidance",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 16, "x": 8, "y": 33 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## WIP Limits\n\nLittle's Law: **Flow Time = Flow Load / Flow Velocity**\n\nTo reduce flow time, either increase velocity or reduce WIP.\n\n| WIP | Interpretation |\n|-----|----------------|\n| 1-2 | Focused. Optimal for solo developer |\n| 3-4 | Manageable. Typical for squad with parallel streams |\n| 5+  | Overloaded. PRs will age, context switching increases |\n\nCurrent squad setup uses 2 persistent worktrees (Squad A + Squad B), so **2-3 open PRs** is the healthy steady state."
      }
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  }
}
